title: "imedR: Guarded Evidence Synthesis for the Indian Microplastics Evidence Database"
type: software
version: "0.3.1"
date-released: "2026-10-08"
authors:
  - family-names: "Naidu"
    given-names: "Chanikya"
    email: "thefisherieschanikyaneeti@gmail.com"
abstract: "A guardrail-first R interface to the Indian Microplastics Evidence Database (IMED). It provides validation, comparability-aware filtering, statistics, meta-analysis helpers, figures, mapping and provenance retrieval, and blocks unsafe pooling across incompatible matrices, units, mass bases and comparability classes."
license: MIT
